107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 54 0 R
/T (navigation, communication and connected services to vehicle occupants. This report presents a conceptual architecture for an IVI system that integrates three feature domains: media playback, turn-by-turn navigation, and smartphone projection \(Android Auto / Apple CarPlay style\). The architecture follows a five-layer model inspired by Android Automotive OS: user input, applications, framework services, hardware abstraction layer \(HAL\) and hardware. Every inter-layer boundary is annotated with the interface used \(Binder/AIDL, HAL interfaces, PCM audio, CAN/NMEA, USB/Wi-Fi\). The report also describes end-to-end data flows for representative scenarios and explains how audio focus arbitration resolves conflicts between media, navigation prompts and phone calls.)
/E (navigation, communication and connected services to vehicle occupants. This report presents a conceptual architecture for an IVI system that integrates three feature domains: media playback, turn-by-turn navigation, and smartphone projection \(Android Auto / Apple CarPlay style\). The architecture follows a five-layer model inspired by Android Automotive OS: user input, applications, framework services, hardware abstraction layer \(HAL\) and hardware. Every inter-layer boundary is annotated with the interface used \(Binder/AIDL, HAL interfaces, PCM audio, CAN/NMEA, USB/Wi-Fi\). The report also describes end-to-end data flows for representative scenarios and explains how audio focus arbitration resolves conflicts between media, navigation prompts and phone calls.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
