/E (devices: radio, music player, GPS navigator and hands-free phone. These functions share scarce resources such as the display, speakers and processor, and they must behave predictably: a navigation prompt must be heard over music, and an incoming call must pause media and resume it afterwards. Safety-related constraints also apply because driver distraction must be minimised.)
