331 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 60 0 R
/T (The proposed five-layer architecture shows how media, navigation and projection can coexist on one IVI platform. Clear interfaces at each boundary, hardware abstraction through HALs, and centralised audio focus arbitration make behaviour predictable and the system maintainable. The scenarios show a complete path for user input to hardware output, and the interruption rules ensure that navigation prompts and phone calls are handled safely and that media resumes automatically.)
/E (The proposed five-layer architecture shows how media, navigation and projection can coexist on one IVI platform. Clear interfaces at each boundary, hardware abstraction through HALs, and centralised audio focus arbitration make behaviour predictable and the system maintainable. The scenarios show a complete path for user input to hardware output, and the interruption rules ensure that navigation prompts and phone calls are handled safely and that media resumes automatically.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 60 0 R
/T (11. Validation Approach)
/E (11. Validation Approach)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 60 0 R
/T (Since this is a conceptual design, validation is by walkthrough. Each scenario in Section 7 is traced from input to output to confirm that every step has an owning component and a defined interface. The audio rules in Section 8 are checked against three conflict cases: navigation during media, a call during navigation, and media resume after a call. As a next step the design can be validated on the Android Automotive emulator by inspecting logcat output for audio focus changes and media session state transitions.)
/E (Since this is a conceptual design, validation is by walkthrough. Each scenario in Section 7 is traced from input to output to confirm that every step has an owning component and a defined interface. The audio rules in Section 8 are checked against three conflict cases: navigation during media, a call during navigation, and media resume after a call. As a next step the design can be validated on the Android Automotive emulator by inspecting logcat output for audio focus changes and media session state transitions.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
