429 0 obj
<<
/Title (The proposed five-layer architecture shows how media, navigation and projection can coexist on one IVI platform. Clear interfaces at each boundary, hardware abstraction through HALs, and centralised audio focus arbitration make behaviour predictable and the system maintainable. The scenarios show a complete path for user input to hardware output, and the interruption rules ensure that navigation prompts and phone calls are handled safely and that media resumes automatically.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 367 0 R
>>
endobj
