522 0 obj
<<
/Title (Since this is a conceptual design, validation is by walkthrough. Each scenario in Section 7 is traced from input to output to confirm that every step has an owning component and a defined interface. The audio rules in Section 8 are checked against three conflict cases: navigation during media, a call during navigation, and media resume after a call. As a next step the design can be validated on the Android Automotive emulator by inspecting logcat output for audio focus changes and media session state transitions.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 472 0 R
>>
endobj
